    "features": "<p>Gang bosses carve out territories in the seedier parts of cities, outposts, and space stations. They strive to gain a hold over the populace through distribution of contraband, intimidation, and/ or subversion of law enforcement. Though many work behind the scenes, they often keep their lot in line through malicious shows of force and cruelty. The gang boss is seldom encountered on their own, usually accompanied by minions who act as enforcers or bodyguards (see Thug later in this section).</p><p><strong>Favored Stunts:</strong> Adrenaline Rush, Vicious Blow</p><p><strong>Talents:</strong> Contacts (Expert), Inspire (Novice), Intrigue (Novice)</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> brass knuckles, combat knife, drug paraphernalia, gang colors, light chain, pistol</p><p><strong>Armor + Toughness:</strong> 2</p>",
    "statBlockView": true
  },
